<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to Jan 17 - USDA. (Livestock</p>
<p>per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		   2,715	    6,155	  519</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 20		109	   25</p>
<p>    Breeding females	     45		158	   48</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     188		188	6,014</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 68		 68	    7</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    445		445	   30</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  3		  8	    6</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    589	    1,241	  255</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
